# Title: DNS Server Discovery Via LDAP Query
# ID: a21bcd7e-38ec-49ad-b69a-9ea17e69509e
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2022-08-20
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1482
# Description: Detects DNS server discovery via LDAP query requests from uncommon applications
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((QueryName:_ldap.*) AND NOT (((process.executable:*:\\ProgramData\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\Platform\\* AND process.executable:*\\MsMpEng.exe) OR ((process.executable:*:\\Program Files\\* OR process.executable:*:\\Program Files (x86)\\* OR process.executable:*:\\Windows\\*)) OR (NOT _exists_:process.executable) OR (process.executable:"<unknown process>"))) AND NOT (((process.executable:C:\\WindowsAzure\\GuestAgent*) OR ((process.executable:*\\chrome.exe OR process.executable:*\\firefox.exe OR process.executable:*\\opera.exe)))))
